GROMACS 2026.3 passes the Message Passing Interface communicator into
PLUMED by value.
Open MPI stores MPI_Comm as a pointer, so PLUMED's TypesafePtr reads
the communicator object as an address and MPI_Comm_dup faults.
Apply this to src/gromacs/applied_forces/plumed/plumedforceprovider.cpp
in the isParallel branch, and build PLUMED and GROMACS against the same
Open MPI.

-        plumed_->cmd("setMPIComm", options.mpiComm_->comm());
+        auto communicator = options.mpiComm_->comm();
+        plumed_->cmd("setMPIComm", &communicator);
